**Test Results Summary**

**Pass:** ✓ All accessibility violations resolved

**Violations Found & Fixed:**
- **[color-contrast]** Impact: serious
  - Element: `#notification-help` (.field-description)
  - Issue: Helper text color (#718096) had insufficient contrast against white background
  - Fix: Changed color from #718096 to #4a5568 to meet WCAG AA 4.5:1 contrast requirement

**Testing Method:** Node.js + Playwright + axe-core (Strategy 2 from testing guide)

